<p>Announcement As of 09/26/96.</p>
<p>Issuer		: Bank of America Variable Rate Ctfs. Series</p>
<p>			  '95A (relating to MBIA ins. Sacramento Co.</p>
<p>			  taxable pension funding ser. '95, term</p>
<p>			  conv. cap. apprec. due 8-15-21)</p>
<p>State		 : CA</p>
<p>Rating		: Aaa/VMIG 1</p>
</text>
